{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42926","headline":"水 · 韩溉","name":"水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"方圆不定性空求，东注沧溟早晚休。\n高截碧塘长耿耿，远飞青嶂更悠悠。\n潇湘月浸千年色，梦泽烟含万古愁。\n别有岭头呜咽处，爲君分作断肠流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩溉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}